{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y 在 S13 把“明知谁也没法答应永远”的清醒判断改成了对时间流逝的担忧，心理因果变得不够准确，X 的原叙事更完整。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y 的重点加亮、感受弱化和按音乐时机出现，让我能先抓住人物当下的心理重点，再随着音乐接收具体的身体感受、音色变化和情绪转折，整体更容易扫读，感受也更细腻。X 的完整叙述在交代人物为什么这样想、为什么这样做，以及串联前后心理变化方面更扎实；Y 虽然视听体验更丰富，但个别地方为了压缩和突出重点，损失了原有的心理逻辑。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "63c7822e-9d9e-4ce5-8ad1-3ee0b9511086", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261107T232000485615Z", "elapsed_seconds": 82.484, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T23:21:22.973052+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "9c80dea0c93939e78252e8d4e82b45ed212fb46ebe95f63d3908aac601161dfa", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py